                       * iterate to convergence                                                          *
                       * sphere                                                                          *
                       * init "dlaw_HI_exp.ini"                                                          *
                       * dlaw table                                                                      *
                       * table SED "QSO.sed"                                                             *
                       * no line transfer                                                                *
